A release of the policy management server has been posted to the
sourceforge site at http://sepolicy-server.sourceforge.net. This release
includes the policy management server daemon with policy modification
enforcement. A walkthrough document is available at the site to
demonstrate the functionality of the server. Although this is 
experimental and should not be used in production we would appreciate 
any testing and feedback from the selinux community.


